  textComponent: {fileID: 1029357744}
  lines:
  - Hey you, I bet you're wondering what you're doing here...
  - Well lucky for you, I have some answers.
  - What you need to do is collect eight Cure Berries... They can be collected around
    the map
  - Then once you do, come back to that little machine by me
  - Press Left Shift to put them cureberries in one at a time...
  - Good luck Putter, don't get yourself hurt.
  textSpeed: 0.03
